{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫59周年台慶盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》日前於將軍澳電視廣播城盛大舉行，現年21歲憑藉出眾身材獲封「聲秀波波」藝人陳卓怡再次成為紅地氈焦點。她一改去年初登場時青澀怕羞形象，今年換上一襲極具設計感黑色馬甲公主裙高調亮相。這套暗黑系戰衣不僅完美修飾其傲人曲線，背後更隱藏著她過去一年經歷地獄式特訓蛻...</p>\n<p>無綫59周年台慶盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》日前於將軍澳電視廣播城盛大舉行，現年21歲憑藉出眾身材獲封「聲秀波波」藝人陳卓怡再次成為紅地氈焦點。她一改去年初登場時青澀怕羞形象，今年換上一襲極具設計感黑色馬甲公主裙高調亮相。這套暗黑系戰衣不僅完美修飾其傲人曲線，背後更隱藏著她過去一年經歷地獄式特訓蛻變痕跡。</p>\n<h2>陳卓怡出戰萬千星輝賀台慶2026紅地氈驚艷全場</h2>\n<p>事隔一年再次踏上台慶紅地氈，陳卓怡緊隨一眾《聲秀》戰友登場，以「暗黑公主風」全新造型示人。她當晚身穿一件復古大方領剪裁黑色晚裝，肩帶特別加入立體蝴蝶結蓬起設計，腰間結合透視薄紗與魚骨馬甲細節，下身則配以點綴立體蝴蝶結蓬鬆紗裙。在髮型方面，她梳起俐落高丸子頭並夾上黑色大蝴蝶結髮飾，配襯珍珠耳環與精緻銀色頸鍊，舉手投足間散發出輕熟名媛氣質，從容面對現場無數閃光燈。</p>\n<h2>聲秀人氣學員告別青澀展現輕熟名媛氣質</h2>\n<p>面對大批傳媒蜂擁追訪與鏡頭捕捉，陳卓怡全程展現出極高心理素質，不僅在紅地氈上從容微笑，在電視城外回眸一瞥亦充滿自信。回顧去年她首次參與台慶盛會並幸運抽中總值超過28萬元大獎時，當時仍是新人上台領獎顯得相當怕羞，面對鏡頭更頻頻伸手擋住胸前試圖封印傲人曲線。今年她完全擺脫昔日拘謹感，大方展現深邃事業線與纖細腰線，將性感與華麗演繹得淋漓盡致。</p>\n<p>\n<h2>網民翻出舊照對比激讚聲秀波波戰衣大進化</h2>\n<p>這套破格性感黑色禮服造型照在社交平台曝光後，隨即引發大批網民熱烈討論。不少忠實擁躉翻出她去年純白深V造型作直接對比，認為其氣場與衣著品味皆有顯著提升。網民紛紛在帖文下方留言激讚：「陳卓怡件黑色晚裝真係完美凸顯身材」、「今年紮起頭髮高貴咗好多，更有女人味」、「由去年怕羞妹變成今年自信女神，進步好大！」相關輿論反應迅速將相關照片推上社交平台熱門話題榜。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542135740549195_7125658616b03f4adca79c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳卓怡 萬千星輝賀台慶2026 （圖片來源：陳卓怡IG）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542135740549195_7125658616b03f4adca79c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：陳卓怡IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542136136563186_20583897156b03f4b1d9cbf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542136136563186_20583897156b03f4b1d9cbf.jpg\" width=\"958\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：陳卓怡IG）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17954213601064781_2378997326b03f4b095f64.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17954213601064781_2378997326b03f4b095f64.jpg\" width=\"915\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：陳卓怡IG）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542135901621678_6855705806b03f4af630ae.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179542135901621678_6855705806b03f4af630ae.jpg\" width=\"883\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：陳卓怡IG）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>台慶紅地氈回顧｜聲秀陳卓怡Hoonry白色戰衣豐滿上圍震撼全場</h2>\n<p>年僅20歲的《聲秀》學員陳卓怡上年首次參與台慶紅地氈，雖然與一眾《聲秀》學員以大堆頭形式登場，但她憑藉一身白色低胸背心晚裝成功突圍而出。黑色束帶設計完美突顯她豐滿的上圍，低胸剪裁令「事業線」盡露，極度震撼眼球。在隨後的抽獎環節中，Hoonry幸運中獎上台領獎，偉大身材再次暴露於觀眾眼前，不過面對鏡頭時顯得相當怕羞，頻頻用手擋住胸前試圖「封印」豐滿曲線。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/galtxy.tic__1763729422_3770758155518339296_6607475216_4708455006921607f5c661-1024x1365.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"陳卓怡 萬千星輝賀台慶2026 （圖片來源：陳卓怡IG）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/galtxy.tic__1763729422_3770758155518339296_6607475216_4708455006921607f5c661-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：陳卓怡IG）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/galtxy.tic__1763729422_3770758155509949910_6607475216_29841482369216081bcf28.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/galtxy.tic__1763729422_3770758155509949910_6607475216_29841482369216081bcf28-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：陳卓怡IG）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/galtxy.tic__1763729422_3770758155677689864_6607475216_17784486166921607d1146e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/galtxy.tic__1763729422_3770758155677689864_6607475216_17784486166921607d1146e-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：陳卓怡IG）\n</figcaption></figure><figure>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/galtxy.tic__1763729422_3770758155509938694_6607475216_12752163606921607acfce5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/galtxy.tic__1763729422_3770758155509938694_6607475216_12752163606921607acfce5-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<figcaption>\n（圖片來源：陳卓怡IG）\n</figcaption></figure>\n<h2></h2>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T08:32:42.793026+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1427,"images":8,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T08:09:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T08:26:12.952133+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T08:26:12.952133+00:00","content_hash":"4f63a975ddcaf2aa81e944442a73ad23d4deec275180e3ec82878caebe6bf691","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}